ht or left hand it is up to you - and one button to shoot and re-bounce the ball. ", "short_description": "Masternoid is a pure arcade brick breaker, reimagined for the age of VR.\n\nImmerse yourself in a bright and colorful world, embrace the meditative power of destruction and ascend to the top of the leaderboards like a true arcade legend.\n\nYou can enjoy the game seated or standing, as minimal physical effort and space is required to play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://masternoid.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pixel Magnet", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://masternoid.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "384791560172704"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 9, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2371518006626190"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1191914845716048"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2353362498437404"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1038657104914894"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1011369904278726"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "531408323314173"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1594880484735822"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "787765182309195"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "513634383548615"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "787765182309195"}, "is_approved"